            "text": "Propose at most 4 projects.\nPreferences: {\"interests\":\"a quiet desk for homework; a second screen for the kitchen; home automation; a smart mirror in the hall; a home server for the photos; a custom NAS from the spare desktop boards and drives; a gaming coffee table with joysticks; a smart desk calendar; a kitchen home-automation dashboard; a weather station; a garage parking helper; retro games on the TV\",\"effort\":\"medium\",\"skills\":[{\"skill\":\"basic computer setup\",\"level\":\"some\"},{\"skill\":\"electronics and soldering\",\"level\":\"some\"},{\"skill\":\"software\",\"level\":\"confident\"}],\"tools\":\"\",\"opens_devices\":false,\"budget\":400.0,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"radius_km\":null,\"purchase\":\"used\"}\nThis time: builds from the UNO board and the sensor modules (a smart desk calendar with the clock module and the buzzer, a kitchen dashboard with the sensors and the relay, a weather station, a garage parking helper)",
